Welcome, @{{author}}, and thank you for {{greeting}}.

What happens next:

- Follow [the CI and review flow]({{repositoryUrl}}/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#how-your-pull-request-lands). If GitHub shows **Awaiting approval**, ask a maintainer here. Later pushes may also need approval.
- Every commit needs a DCO sign-off. Follow [the commit instructions]({{repositoryUrl}}/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#commit-and-pull-request-style); ask a maintainer before repairing a published commit rather than rewriting shared history or adding a certification you are not entitled to make.
- Someone other than you verifies the change before it lands, and posts what they checked here.

[CONTRIBUTING.md]({{repositoryUrl}}/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) has the details, and [Discussions]({{repositoryUrl}}/discussions) is the place for questions.
